{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8110f2a182e6463ec333d2611a7af7f3cc650da77efedcd8bacdec2dc461384c", "ja": "（翼から急に呼び出しを受けた。\n控え室で待っているとの事だけど、何だろう？）", "zh": "（翼突然把我叫出来，\n只说了在准备室见，到底有什么事呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "75a5c54d10e09f47347fdbbab7895126015cb9322a652fe758c1ba8199ccda1c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ！\nこの間はごほうび、ありがとうございまーす！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生来了！\n谢谢你之前给的奖励～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "95194b7677967eaf3c69567689eb46b2b1666d08ffa63876980bafd8d50c722a", "ja": "きれいなドレスを着て、夜の展望台デート♪\nすっごくロマンチックでしたよね～。", "zh": "让我穿上美美的洋装，晚上带我到观景台约会♪\n真的好浪漫喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1003_p", "source_sha256": "af49232bdec2ef1555dd23241d7946875093f20e1851b9902f12084bfa6b73ae", "ja": "デートというか、ライブ成功のご褒美で\n夜景を見に行っただけだけどな。", "zh": "不是约会，是因为演唱会很成功，\n所以带你去看夜景当作奖励而已啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f0b183afb8ca9c688d796d725db5ce3e234fecddbcbecaa12416a26a249e125", "ja": "え～。あれって、デートじゃなかったんですか？\nあの展望台、カップルでいっぱいでしたよ？", "zh": "咦～那样不算约会吗？\n观景台上可是有一对又一对的情侣耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ecc717f93f8e3d75cc4a1e67f291351abe1f9ed19a634b36bd9ae5e9132dce40", "ja": "みんな、すっごくオシャレしてたし……\n大人って、いつもあんなデートしてるんですね～。", "zh": "而且大家都打扮得好时髦……\n原来大人都是那样约会的呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1fbbef050ea8927dd341c52218333e60eeea65d91691069c2779ebc95739a58d", "ja": "いいな～。わたしも、\nもっとあんなところでデートしたいかも♪", "zh": "真羡慕～\n连我也想多去那种地方约会了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "13d453589189ed42a674bafda9a2fee0300902692ab8b6268ef2911d04a674f1", "ja": "あんなロマンチックな所でデートする\n中学生なんて、そうそういないと思うけど……。", "zh": "我是觉得没几个国中生\n会到那种浪漫的地方约会啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bba88aea88072dba7f11c16f1a473f0b821e8d6bf645701268784ecf4dc69073", "ja": "そう焦らなくても、翼が大人になったら\n連れて行ってくれる人ができるよ。", "zh": "翼，你不用着急，等你长大以后，\n自然会找到对象带你去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "56eb72cfeacdc5808cd6df607e071dcc2e4461d31b04e19773ffb5b4045b7c8c", "ja": "それって、ずっと先の話じゃないですか。\nそんなに待てませんよ～！", "zh": "那不是还要很久吗？\n我等不了那么久啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "95f21246fb5c9b475104a265dcf4a34f79b11dc08d85c3dfcaea2fa6bccc8d75", "ja": "それに、わたしは{$P$}さんに\n連れて行ってほしいんです。", "zh": "而且，我想要{$P$}先生带我去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d98142dbdd51cebf96095edbcc7533ae38658fb7e29f8aca1cdc4c22abe93674", "ja": "だから次も、夜景がきれいなところで……\nあ、あとあと、ディナー付きのデートがしたいな～♪", "zh": "所以下次约会，也要去夜景很美的地方……\n啊，还有还有，最好能有烛光晚餐～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "31a126a0903e4babf23285a7a9ba9e2250e56799d094848e1a63321ee4b4b89a", "ja": "そういう豪華なご褒美は、翼が\nもっとアイドルとして成長できたらな。", "zh": "这么豪华的奖励，\n等你在偶像这方面有更多成长再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1013_p", "source_sha256": "721b0231ba832730a8c96d908e21dc43c1de2f13d2d0b96228d60f3ad2ec9c0a", "ja": "というか……普通の大人は、翼が想像してるような\nデートは、あまりしてないと思うけど。", "zh": "而且……翼你想像中的那种约会，\n我想一般大人应该也不常那样做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f9756c42734b2d608bd4c7a18daae85830e672ce1bf4ab8c1099757710ba3487", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　\nじゃあ、本当はどこにデートしにいくんですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？\n那大家都是去哪约会的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8e09c8b337a9eb19af94fc902d8ced7c050c46426b6fd8f6dfb6e79f1e7042bc", "ja": "どこにって……。うーん、まあ、\n好きなところに行くんじゃないかな？", "zh": "你问去哪……嗯……这个嘛，\n就是去喜欢的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1016_p", "source_sha256": "aab0960625ce8f1653916777b9fd9d109b5c778e1c13f95b9b2a032693137222", "ja": "大人だからって、みんながみんな豪華なデートを\nしている訳ではない。……はずだ。", "zh": "并不是每个大人的约会都走奢华路线……\n应该是这样啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b49f305852ba11b45ee63395595876d62fc6bba0d226a9e002a6eedb52707a6", "ja": "ふ～ん、そうなんだ。\n……。", "zh": "哦～是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b06fcf65a3bbcc76c2b8fb933ac97c83394fd1950390c586bccaf089eb6a5176", "ja": "だったら次は、{$P$}さんが\n行きたい所に行きましょうよ！", "zh": "既然这样，那下次就去{$P$}先生\n想去的地方吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2a83eadd70e6eb6dcff41865ca6788441252d55e611718531855bf76c9a99d81", "ja": "次のお仕事をがんばったら、ごほうびに！\nね？　いいですよね？　はい、きまり～！", "zh": "等我下次在工作时有好表现，再来奖励我！\n好吗？可以吧？那就这么决定啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3de67e98314cd81806cbaa340c53109e665d6d7e4e746193bb031f2303559f1c", "ja": "仕方ないな……。じゃあレッスンをサボらずに、\n次のライブもちゃんと成功させる事！　いいな？", "zh": "真拿你没辙……那训练课程时不可以缺席，\n而且还要让下场演唱会尽善尽美！可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0133_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "99d91bcfc911dcab853b903d325013256db002bd9531c5e60e8843b332e3ecfd", "ja": "やった！　えへへっ、どんな服着ていこーかな？\n{$P$}さんとのデート、楽しみ～♪", "zh": "太棒了！嘿嘿，到时要穿哪件衣服好呢？\n跟{$P$}先生约会，好期待唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
